      "message": "feat(mcp): load_machine and get_job report the post the machine names\n\nA QA run on #2374 mounted the Tormach 770MX over MCP and posted Fanuc:\nnothing told the agent that the machine names Tormach PathPilot.\npost_offer_for asks for any setup (post_offer stays the active\nsetup's, for the Setup page's banner), and moves to posting_offer.rs.\nload_machine replies with post_offer for the setup it mounted to, and\nget_job gives each setup's post_offer: the post, why, and the\nset_setup_post call that takes it. The mount still changes nothing.\nThe post tool's description lists every BUILTINS name, not a\nhand-written list that had lost \"Tormach PathPilot\".\n\nRefs #2374\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
