      "message": "feat(machine): the Machines file editor picks the machine's post from a dropdown\n\nThe General group gains a Post row for controller.post. It is a dropdown\n(Field.choices) of the built-in posts that serve the file's kind, plus\n\"(none)\", which takes the key out. A stated name off the list stays in\nview with its refusal.\n\nRefs #2374\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
