      "message": "test(examples): the continuous 4-axis example carries the machine's post name\n\nThe committed project stores its machine. The microARC 4 file now states controller.post, so the test's own update path (WRITE_GOLDEN=1) saves the project again. The only change is \"post\": \"Tormach PathPilot\" under /machine/machine. The committed .nc is kept: the same update path on plain main (08697d3c4) rewrites the same 7 A words by one last digit, and this branch posts byte for byte what main posts.\n\nRefs #2374\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
